@page "/about"

<PageTitle>About · SlopFactory</PageTitle>
<header class="page-header"><div><p class="eyebrow">About</p><h1>SlopFactory</h1><p class="muted">Development build 0.1.0</p></div></header>
<section class="panel prose">
    <h2>Local-first AI media library</h2>
    <p>SlopFactory stores its library database and managed files on this device. Library content is not application-level encrypted.</p>
    <p>This development milestone implements configurable local libraries, managed imports and duplication, folders, text viewing and Edit as Copy, raster image viewing, user metadata, file links, schema upgrades, and recycle-bin recovery. Provider connections and generation are still planned.</p>
</section>
